<title>USA: AIG's Int'l Lease Finance Corp files $2 bln shelf.</title>
<headline>AIG's Int'l Lease Finance Corp files $2 bln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Lease Finance Corp filed a registration statement to offer up to $2 billion in debt securities.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the unit of American International Group Inc said the proceeds would go toward general corporate purposes, including the acquisition of aircraft.</p>
<p>International Lease Finance acquires new and used commercial jets and leases and sells them to domestic and foreign airlines.</p>
</text>
